    "fabric": {
      "type": "cb-accordions",
      "blocks": {
        "fabric_1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What fabrics do CAS abayas come in, and which are best for everyday or special occasions?",
            "answer": "<p>CAS Abaya offers many fabrics to suit different needs. For daily wear, <strong>Nada</strong> is a luxurious, soft and lightweight fabric, and <strong>Crepe</strong> is also comfortable and breathable (with a slight texture and drape). <strong>Chiffon</strong> is lightweight and airy (often layered to avoid transparency). For work or formal wear, <strong>Jacquard</strong> and <strong>Soft Jacquard</strong> are textured, durable fabrics with a sophisticated look. For special events (weddings, parties), we use richer fabrics like <strong>Bridal Satin</strong> (heavy with subtle shine) and <strong>Dantel lace</strong> (intricate, feminine). <strong>Velvet</strong>, <strong>Suede</strong>, and <strong>Tweed</strong> are heavier winter fabrics, while <strong>Linen</strong> is a cool, breathable fabric ideal for summer.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "fabric_2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are CAS abayas see-through or transparent?",
            "answer": "<p>Most CAS abayas are designed using premium fabrics that provide comfortable coverage while maintaining elegance. Some lightweight fabrics such as chiffon may naturally be more sheer; however, these designs are usually layered or can be customized with additional lining (batana) for extra coverage. Customers can request lining if they prefer a more opaque finish.</p>"
          }
        },
        "fabric_3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I choose a fabric for hot weather or everyday comfort?",
            "answer": "<p>For hot climates and casual wear, we recommend lighter fabrics. <strong>Nada</strong>, <strong>Crepe</strong>, and <strong>Chiffon</strong> are all lightweight and breathable. <strong>Linen</strong> is specifically noted for summer wear – it’s natural, airy and durable. These fabrics keep you cool while maintaining elegance.</p>"
          }
        },
        "fabric_4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are CAS fabrics suitable for daily wear and long hours of use?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. CAS carefully selects fabrics that combine comfort, durability, and elegance. Fabrics like Nada, Crepe, Soft Jacquard, and Linen are particularly popular for everyday wear because they are breathable, lightweight, and easy to carry for long hours while maintaining a polished and modest look.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
