    "fit": {
      "type": "cb-accordions",
      "blocks": {
        "fit_1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I ensure my abaya will fit correctly?",
            "answer": "<p>Custom abayas are made to your measurements. We work from <strong>abaya (garment) measurements, not body measurements</strong>. Please measure an existing abaya (chest, hips, length, sleeves from neck, shoulder) in inches. We also offer standard sizes (XXS to 6XL) and can customize any length. If fit issues arise after delivery, we provide alterations or replacements (see Returns & Exchanges below)</p>"
          }
        },
        "fit_2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What abaya styles do you offer (open front vs closed front)?",
            "answer": "<p>CAS abayas come in various styles. An <strong>open-front</strong> abaya is like a coat that buttons down the front. We can also make <strong>half-closed</strong> (with 3–4 buttons) or <strong>fully closed front</strong> designs. In fact, we can create a completely closed-front abaya that you wear over the head. All our styles are designed for modesty; choose the front style that you’re most comfortable with. Necklines are also customizable (V-neck, round, high, etc.).<br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "fit_3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What customizations are available and are they free?",
            "answer": "<p>Many customizations are <strong>free of charge</strong>. We tailor every abaya to your exact size (any size up to 6XL and any length up to 63″). You can add or remove features at no extra cost: for example, add buttons to the front or sleeves, include zip or button closures (useful for moms), insert side or front pockets, and choose any neckline (V, round, high). You can even remove our logo from the abaya or sheila if you wish.<br/><br/>A few enhancements carry a small fee: for example, adding a full lining (batana) under the abaya is AED 70, adding an extra chiffon layer is AED 100, and extending the sheila beyond the standard length costs AED 40. We’ll always tell you about any charges before completing your order.</p>"
          }
        },
        "fit_4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you have options for pregnant or nursing mothers?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. We can adjust the size and cut to accommodate pregnancy. For nursing, we offer practical features: for example, <strong>zippers or buttons can be added</strong> to our inner dresses to facilitate breastfeeding. Just let us know your needs when ordering.</p>"
          }
        },
        "fit_5": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I have a size Guide?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, you can find our size guide here: <a href=\"/pages/abaya-size-chart\" title=\"Abaya Size Chart\">Abaya size guide</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "fit_6": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I provide measurements, and how long does a custom order take?",
            "answer": "<p><br/>Please send us your <strong>measurements in inches</strong>: chest, hips, abaya length, sleeve length (from neck), and shoulder width. We recommend measuring a similar abaya for accuracy. After ordering, most custom abayas are ready in <strong>10–12 business days</strong>. During busy seasons (Ramadan/Eid) allow up to 12–15 days. If you need an abaya sooner, check our<a href=\"/collections/ready-to-wear\" title=\"Ready to Wear Abayas\"> Ready-to-Wear collection </a>(delivered in 1–2 days within the UAE).<br/></p>"
          }
        }
      },
